[10.040529, "o", "# sysdiag\r\n\r\n`sysdiag` is an internal systems diagnostics and operational reporting tool.\r\nIt gathers system resource information and network reachability to assist in infrastructure triage.\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nsysdiag --output /var/diagnostics/report.json\r\n```\r\n"]
